'''Fire Aegis''' is a [[skill]] that applies a protective [[buff]] on the character and absorbs [[fire damage]] from [[hit]]s up to a certain amount before it temporarily dissipates.

[[File:Fire Aegis skill animation.gif|thumb|200px|skill animation]]
==Acquisition==
Fire Aegis can only be obtained by equipping {{il|Invictus Solaris}}, having a capacity of 1000.

